Error [E3401]: `compute` calls or reaches impure effects `IO`
  --> pure_fn_inferred_interpolation_and_io_is_e3401.jet:6:1
    |
  6 | fn compute(value: Int) -[]> String { return format(value) }
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A pure function must produce the same result without ambient effects
 Fix: Remove the call that introduces `IO`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `compute` so its effects are inferred
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3401
